tps://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rpenrLDdurwQ7kNvwH1ggZZ&_nc_oc=Adrq1EUl2-Z-h9uD181GrKCIP4zc0dzcmFiynpeicudxikZ_y3htXZyrS5fzUyh0ImU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQyHdjYFgtZGWry3qXw55eRNePbOY5q4EUWnyx6QHSkvw&oe=6AF8892E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=10cym9VNAA4Q7kNvwGEIAM2&_nc_oc=Adr7SJGW7R8dLj3ar789-6tsG3OyxmNtnc3kDw2pRls77IyELX467ZJE_etSzcN3RvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqmBhpdEZ_URWj8KsD3Yu9pJK4WjI8U-Q2QB4ca6P5tA&oe=6AF87D8A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cy6DMI2ytmIQ7kNvwGKq3ch&_nc_oc=AdrxAMy37yQgBtsEz3Fp0GXzr4clYRb_tMvDB5sJYso-n0E2_oYD27ixJJ8wXcelXpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOzyUn9Q411R0ij-LvrbX8ICUKZ0359QLq4-xWXdSKew&oe=6AF8A4EB"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ui-pFqTdP-8Q7kNvwES2q4X&_nc_oc=AdqNfo2s-aQ5ls_RXPujkPMpjL8dcAbVAy4cB7iIvlf0znv4RcaL8j-8edpCChEP7DQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLT_c5aH4r3xjzafttJUpoIkbjb88tVn2Q7QNI6OM62A&oe=6AF891F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lgjwiPAGZBMQ7kNvwEFCSMo&_nc_oc=Adqr6lzC2aJvEIqbikjpI8C0MKuuOayxq5YPPgGAbYl26a-F4MPDEeVdMBWoeiQZ7TM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZmiQFlpH50nr3ajQgbeB0n3776Zc8hQ0nFzpI7PH1jA&oe=6AF891B8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv